{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21327","headline":"张旧蚊帱 · 元稹","name":"张旧蚊帱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"踰年间生死，千里旷南北。\n家居无见期，况乃异乡国。\n破尽裁缝衣，忘收遗翰墨。\n独有缬纱帱，凭人远携得。\n施张合欢榻，展卷双鸳翼。\n已矣长空虚，依然旧颜色。\n裴回将就寝，徙倚情何极。\n昔透香田田，今无魂恻恻。\n隙穿斜月照，灯背空床黑。\n达理强开怀，梦啼还过臆。\n平生贫寡欢，夭枉劳苦忆。\n我亦距几时，胡爲自摧逼。\n烛蛾焰中舞，蠒蚕丛上织。\n燋烂各自求，他人顾何力。\n多离因苟合，恶影当务息。\n往事勿复言，将来幸前识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21327.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21327","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}